// gitui's default theme draws in the terminal's ANSI colours, so the
// terminal's scheme (one per theme family and mode) recolours it. Only the
// fills are overridden: no ANSI colour reads as a background under text in
// every family, so the selection and the command bar get none, and the
// selected line is marked by its text colour instead: Blue, which gitui
// uses for no text of its own. selection_fg recolours selected files,
// commits and diff lines; selected folder and tag rows take command_fg,
// which also colours the command bar.
(
    selection_bg: Some("Reset"),
    selection_fg: Some("Blue"),
    cmdbar_bg: Some("Reset"),
    cmdbar_extra_lines_bg: Some("Reset"),
    command_fg: Some("Blue"),
)
